WEBVTT

00:00:05.155 --> 00:00:08.752
Choose Donations in the side menu.

00:00:09.002 --> 00:00:11.922
Click addondemo01.

00:00:12.172 --> 00:00:16.974
Check that Receipt queued
shows under the reference.

00:00:17.224 --> 00:00:20.688
Click Donations in the top path.

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:23.893
Click addondemo04.

00:00:24.143 --> 00:00:30.143
Check that Receipt not queued shows
because the gift is still pending.
